invariant: INV-14
file: quic_config.c
catches: quic_loop_webpki
reason: a TRUST=webpki QUIC client takes an ALPN offer of no protocol,
  which webpki_cfg_ok admits because a TCP client may offer none, and
  RFC 9001 §8.1 makes ALPN mandatory for QUIC. The empty-offer row in
  test/quic_loop_webpki.h objects.

--- old
    return cfg->alpn_protocols != NULL && cfg->alpn_count > 0;
--- new
    return cfg != NULL;
